---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = '26 October 2026';
---
<Base title="Terms & Disclaimer | Turfwise"
  description="The Turfwise lawn fertilizer calculator gives planning estimates. Product labels and local rules come first."
  path="/terms/">
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="eyebrow on-dark">Terms &amp; disclaimer</p>
        <h1>Estimates, not instructions</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated {updated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="shell prose">
      <h2>A planning aid</h2>
      <p>Turfwise works out quantities from the numbers you enter and from published university extension formulas. The results are estimates to help you plan and shop. They are not professional advice.</p>
      <h2>Your label and your local rules come first</h2>
      <p>Always read and follow the label on the product you use. If the label's rate, timing or warnings differ from anything on this site, the label is right. Some states and towns limit phosphorus or restrict when lawn fertilizer can be applied; check with your local extension office.</p>
      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>We work to keep the formulas and ranges accurate and cite our <a href="/method/">sources</a>, but we cannot promise the site is free of errors or suited to your lawn, climate or product. You use it at your own risk.</p>
      <h2>Independent</h2>
      <p>Turfwise is not affiliated with any fertilizer maker or retailer. Product names, if mentioned, belong to their owners.</p>
      <p><a href="/">Back to the calculator</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
